---
import DocumentationLayout from '../layouts/DocumentationLayout.astro';
import ComponentPreview from '../components/docs/ComponentPreview.astro';
import {Button} from '../components/dmf-ui/button';
import {components} from '../data/documentation';
---
<DocumentationLayout title="DMF UI" description="A source-owned UI foundation with shared components and product presets." section="home">
<section class="docs-hero"><h1>A shared foundation. Room for your product.</h1><p class="docs-lead">DMF UI brings Fulldev-based components, semantic tokens and product presets into one source-owned Astro library.</p><div class="docs-actions"><Button as="a" href="/components/" class="no-underline">Explore components</Button><Button as="a" href="/docs/installation/" variant="outline" class="text-foreground no-underline">Get started</Button></div><p class="docs-note">Experimental · Astro adapter · {components.length} component families</p></section>
<div class="docs-preview-grid"><ComponentPreview slug="button"/><ComponentPreview slug="tabs"/></div>
<section class="docs-section"><h2>Build with a clear starting point.</h2><div class="docs-grid"><article class="docs-entry"><a href="/components/">Components</a><p>Try the implemented components, inspect their options and bring the same source into your project.</p></article><article class="docs-entry"><a href="/docs/theming/">Tokens and presets</a><p>Use semantic roles, then apply your product’s colors and typography. DMF and the CB UI reconstruction share the same components.</p></article><article class="docs-entry"><a href="/docs/accessibility/">Behavior and accessibility</a><p>Review keyboard behavior, form semantics, scoped lifecycle and the manual checks that remain.</p></article><article class="docs-entry"><a href="/docs/introduction/">Own the foundation</a><p>The standalone repository owns the source. Astro works today; a separate React alpha is available for evaluation. Stable React and WordPress support remain planned.</p></article></div></section>
<p class="docs-note docs-section">Adapted from <a href="https://ui.full.dev/">Fulldev UI</a>, with shadcn/ui, Tailwind CSS, Data Slot and Lucide. <a href="/docs/credits/">Read the credits and notices.</a></p>
</DocumentationLayout>
